Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.59,0:23:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 太好喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.44,0:23:16.71,screen2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435,91)}来看PV吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.87,0:23:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"Live Start"也正式上传了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.17,0:23:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的真零特别好喝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.01,0:23:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.06,0:23:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.34,0:23:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还不止这样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里要公布一项超超超重大消息
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.47,0:23:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那我要说了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.39,0:23:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我终于…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.03,0:23:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也成为前辈啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.33,0:23:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,淡雪阁下…
